          "title": "Ollama",
          "date_added": "2026-04-25",
          "content": "# Ollama\n\nDaily-driver wrapper around llama.cpp with a model registry, daemon, and OpenAI-compatible API. The default for most local users.\n\n## Install & first run\n\n*(install on macOS / Linux / Windows; `ollama run llama3.2`)*\n\n## Pulling and managing models\n\n*(`ollama pull`, `ollama list`, `ollama rm`, tag conventions like `:7b-q4_K_M`)*\n\n## Running a model\n\n*(`ollama run`, system prompts, multi-line input, `/bye`)*\n\n## Modelfiles\n\n*(custom system prompt, parameter tweaks, importing a local GGUF, `ollama create`)*\n\n## OpenAI-compatible API\n\n*(`http://localhost:11434/v1`, drop-in for OpenAI SDKs, streaming)*\n\n## Tuning\n\n*(`OLLAMA_NUM_PARALLEL`, `OLLAMA_MAX_LOADED_MODELS`, `num_ctx`, GPU layer split, keep-alive)*\n\n## Resources\n\n- [Ollama](https://ollama.com)\n- [Ollama Library](https://ollama.com/library)\n\n## Notes\n\n*(none yet)*"
